        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "faf62d99-3f31-5b13-81cd-59d4297dc857",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. J. Singh, Kanwarjit Singh Sawhney, Vishal Bhardwaj, Gulzar, Shajith Koyeri, Subash Sahu\n- Films: Omkara\n- Awards: 54th National Film Award for Best Audiography, Filmfare Award for Best Sound Design\n- Places: Mumbai\n\nFacts:\n- K. J. Singh, also known as Kanwarjit Singh Sawhney, is an Indian audio engineer based in Mumbai.\n- In 2006, K. J. Singh worked on the film Omkara.\n- For Omkara, Vishal Bhardwaj composed the entire music, including the background score, and Gulzar wrote the lyrics.\n- K. J. Singh won the 54th National Film Award for Best Audiography for his work on Omkara.\n- K. J. Singh, Shajith Koyeri, and Subash Sahu won the Filmfare Award for Best Sound Design for their work on Omkara.",
